<title>NORWAY: TENNIS-NORWAY LEAD NIGERIA 3-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NORWAY LEAD NIGERIA 3-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway took an unbeatable 3-0 lead against Nigeria in their Davis Cup Euro/African zone group two, first round tie on Saturday.</p>
<p>Doubles result: Christian Ruud/Helge Koll beat Sule Ladipo/Ganiyu Adelekan 6-2 4-6 6-1 7-6 (7-5)</p>
